      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Who Should Avoid It"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Pregnant or breastfeeding individuals: Safety is not established."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "People with autoimmune conditions: It may overstimulate the immune system."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Those on certain medications: It can interact with sedatives, thyroid hormones, diabetes drugs, and blood pressure medications. More details can be found on the National Institutes of Health consumer guidance page.",
